  "question": {
    "text": "The de-Broglie wavelength of an electron is the same as that of a photon. If velocity of electron is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn><mo>%</mo></math> of the velocity of light, then the ratio of K.E. of electron and K.E. of photon will be:",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "8AKzj",
